      "title": "[P2] Invalidate preflight cache when non-HEAD inputs change",
      "body": "The preflight cache only keys on `HEAD` SHA, but the payload also depends on data that can change without a commit move (notably Studio `policyMode` from `studio.json`, and other local context checks). After such updates, this path can keep returning stale preflight data indefinitely until `HEAD` changes, which makes the UI show outdated readiness/mode state. The cache key or invalidation strategy needs to include these dependencies.",
